  "text": "the app takes up way too much space; Settings is a wall of buttons. Packs only reskin; fix how the screens are built. Agreed plan: settings as short lists you tap into (like phone settings), dropdowns instead of rows of buttons, tight spacing everywhere; start with Settings and show before/after screenshots. Profile: Angel. Layouts stay as they are (Brett: 'Nah' to new layouts). Web first; Android twin of the settings renderer recorded as deferred (Android hold).",
